  "remarks": "Joint Stock Company “Red October Corporation” is one of Russia’s largest producers of specialty steel, accounting for 40 % of the country’s total stainless steel production. The company controls up to two-thirds of Russian production of special steels and alloys used in weapons systems, including armor steel. Joint Stock Company “Red October Corporation” holds licences from the Ministry of Industry and Trade of the Russian Federation authorising the development, production, testing, maintenance and sale of weapons, military equipment and ammunition, as well as the development, production, testing and repair of aviation equipment.",
